KKEMwDw==&rs=AOn4CLBvG4YxCOGu1i37YiIB9C_nI_0ojA\", \"height\": 188, \"width\": 336, \"preference\": -7, \"id\": \"36\", \"resolution\": \"336x188\"}, {\"url\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AQ0resnXCcE/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCOADEOgC8quKqQMa8AEB-AH-CYAC0AWKAgwIABABGGUgSihDMA8=&rs=AOn4CLCDNWzy7sbSD0A6UYKe4tbZ52Tfwg\", \"height\": 360, \"width\": 480, \"preference\": -7, \"id\": \"37\", \"resolution\": \"480x360\"}, {\"url\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/AQ0resnXCcE/hqdefault.webp\", \"preference\": -6, \"id\": \"38\"}, {\"url\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AQ0resnXCcE/sddefault.jpg\", \"preference\": -5, \"id\": \"39\"}, {\"url\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AQ0resnXCcE/sddefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCIAFEOAD8quKqQMa8AEB-AH-CYAC0AWKAgwIABABGGUgSihDMA8=&rs=AOn4CLDbGPNNebdScBaRDldEi7xwH3sseA\", \"height\": 480, \"width\": 640, \"preference\": -5, \"id\": \"40\", \"resolution\": \"640x480\"}, {\"url\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/AQ0resnXCcE/sddefault.webp\", \"preference\": -4, \"id\": \"41\"}, {\"url\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AQ0resnXCcE/hq720.jpg\", \"preference\": -3, \"id\": \"42\"}, {\"url\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/AQ0resnXCcE/hq720.webp\", \"preference\": -2, \"id\": \"43\"}, {\"url\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AQ0resnXCcE/maxresdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCIAKENAF8quKqQMa8AEB-AH-CYAC0AWKAgwIABABGGUgSihDMA8=&rs=AOn4CLC0_op95HpnRO-FqvrEWCr4vxUuJw\", \"preference\": -1, \"id\": \"44\"}, {\"url\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AQ0resnXCcE/maxresdefault.jpg\", \"height\": 1080, \"width\": 1920, \"preference\": -1, \"id\": \"45\", \"resolution\": \"1920x1080\"}, {\"url\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/AQ0resnXCcE/maxresdefault.webp\", \"preference\": 0, \"id\": \"46\"}], \"thumbnail\": \"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AQ0resnXCcE/maxresdefault.jpg\", \"description\": \"Hardwell - United We Are (Album) \\u2192 http://bit.ly/UNITEDWEARE\\n\\nSubscribe to my channel now! \\u2192 http://bit.ly/HardwellTube\\nJoin me on Facebook \\u2192 http://bit.ly/HardwellFB\\nFollow me on Spotify \\u2192 http://spoti.fi/1tkoy1r\\n\\nDownload on iTunes: http://bit.ly/YoungAgainiTunes\\nStream on Spotify: http://spoti.fi/1wjltCw\\n\\nCurrent world #1 DJ Hardwell has had an extraordinary 2014. From continuing to rule supreme over the dance music world, reeling off top-charting hit after hit with epic releases such as \\u2018Dare You\\u2019, \\u2018Everybody Is In The Place\\u2019, the iconic Dutch producer now delivers the newest single \\u2018Young Again\\u2019, from his forthcoming debut album, which is also equipped to hit a high note amongst the charts. Always one to nurture the brightest talents in the industry, Hardwell has enlisted British vocalist Chris Jones, to add a raw, rock-orientated tone, to his euphoric, soaring melodies.\\nPowered with emotion, \\u2018Young Again\\u2019 is a merger of genre-bending bliss, fusing rootsy, electro-acoustic guitar strings with Jones\\u2019s powerful vocals that command attention the second the track begins, a new anthem is truly unleashed. Questioning \\u201cWill We Ever Feel Young Again?\\u201d, as the track switches between towering club beats and dominant drops, key chords pound beneath the catchy melody, accumulating in a vocal-driven club stormer with mass appeal. \\nHighlighting Hardwell\\u2019s sheer versatility by stepping out of the traditional, progressive-house blueprint and daring to be different, by not being pinned down to a specific strain of dance music and finding inspiration all around him, \\u2018Young Again\\u2019 is an infectious record readied to dominate the charts and one that is setting up the imminent release of his new artist album very nicely! \\n\\nFor more info check:\\nhttp://www.djhardwell.com\\nhttp://www.facebook.com/djhardwell\\nhttp://www.twitter.com/hardwell\\nhttp://www.soundcloud.com/hardwell\\nhttp://www.instagram.com/hardwell\", \"channel_id\": \"UCPT5Q93YbgJ_7du1gV7UHQQ\", \"channel_url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPT5Q93YbgJ_7du1gV7UHQQ\", \"duration\": 220, \"view_coun